      "content": "\"pre-emptive emotional alignment\" is a scary way to put it. so if they can condition people to bypass their critical faculties just by using certain words, what's the next step? \n\nif these phrases are basically training us to be more compliant and less questioning, does that mean the language itself is being used as a tool for mass behavioral control? like, if a government or a global entity adopted these same semantic structures, could they use them to induce a state of passive obedience on a much larger scale?",
